"No matching Ctrl+C or Ctrl+V decision reached this check within 60 seconds. This does not prove the keyboard sent nothing." = "60 秒內沒有收到匹配的 Ctrl+C 或 Ctrl+V 處理結果。這不代表鍵盤沒有傳送按鍵。";

"Switch to ChatGPT or Claude and press Ctrl+C or Ctrl+V once. Return here for the result. The check stops after one shortcut or 60 seconds." = "切換到 ChatGPT 或 Claude，按一次 Ctrl+C 或 Ctrl+V，然後返回這裡檢視結果。檢查在捕獲一次快速鍵後或 60 秒後停止。";

"Live check: your shortcut runs normally. Only one ChatGPT or Claude Ctrl+C or Ctrl+V decision is kept in memory. No text, selection or clipboard content is collected." = "實際按鍵檢查：快速鍵照常執行。記憶體中只保留一次 ChatGPT 或 Claude Ctrl+C 或 Ctrl+V 的處理結果，不收集正文、選取範圍或剪貼板內容。";

// Automatic VS Code integration
"Automatically configure VS Code terminal" = "自動設定 VS Code 終端機";
"Ctrl+C copies and clears a terminal selection, or interrupts when nothing is selected. Ctrl+V pastes. Ctrl+Shift+C/V also work." = "Ctrl+C 拷貝並清除終端機選取範圍；沒有選取範圍時中斷命令。Ctrl+V 貼上，也支援 Ctrl+Shift+C/V。";
"Open VS Code once. Terminal support will be configured automatically." = "開啟一次 VS Code，終端機支援將自動設定。";
"VS Code terminal support is configured automatically. No window reload is normally needed." = "VS Code 終端機支援已自動設定，通常無需重新載入視窗。";
"Automatic VS Code terminal support is off. Windsify terminal bindings have been removed." = "VS Code 自動終端機支援已關閉，Windsify 的終端機規則已移除。";

"Pro automatically configures your local VS Code profiles and backs up existing shortcuts. Turning this off removes Windsify's terminal bindings. Custom user-data directories on the internal disk are also supported. Workspace shortcut overrides may require review." = "Pro 自動設定本機的 VS Code 設定檔，並備份原有快速鍵。關閉後會移除 Windsify 的終端機規則。也支援正在執行的 VS Code 在內建磁碟上的自訂資料目錄。工作區的快速鍵覆蓋設定可能需要檢查。";

"Some VS Code instances could not be configured. Their terminal shortcuts remain native." = "部分 VS Code 實例無法自動設定，其終端機快速鍵保持原生行為。";

"A VS Code profile uses a symbolic link. Automatic terminal support needs a local profile directory." = "某個 VS Code 設定檔使用符號連結。自動終端機支援需要本地設定檔目錄。";

"VS Code sends shortcuts directly to the shell. Turn off terminal.integrated.sendKeybindingsToShell to enable terminal support." = "VS Code 目前將快速鍵直接傳送給 Shell。請關閉 terminal.integrated.sendKeybindingsToShell 後使用終端機支援。";

"Automatic VS Code setup requires a profile on this Mac's internal disk. External or network profiles are left unchanged to avoid background file-access prompts." = "自動設定需要 VS Code 設定位於本機內建磁碟。外接磁碟或網路磁碟設定保持不變，以免背景觸發檔案存取提示。";

"Spotlight could not open" = "無法開啟 Spotlight 搜尋";
"Windsify cannot open Spotlight because Show Spotlight search is disabled or its shortcut is unavailable. In System Settings > Keyboard > Keyboard Shortcuts > Spotlight, enable Show Spotlight search and choose a shortcut that does not conflict with input-source switching, then try again." = "“顯示 Spotlight 搜尋”未啟用或其快速鍵不可用，Windsify 無法開啟 Spotlight 搜尋。請前往系統設定 > 鍵盤 > 鍵盤快速鍵 > Spotlight，啟用“顯示 Spotlight 搜尋”，並設定一個不與輸入法切換衝突的快速鍵，然後重試。";
"Windsify could not send the configured Spotlight shortcut. Restart Windsify and try again. You can still open Spotlight from the menu bar." = "Windsify 無法傳送已設定的 Spotlight 搜尋快速鍵。請重新啟動 Windsify 後重試。你仍可從選單欄開啟 Spotlight 搜尋。";
"Windows key search" = "Windows 鍵搜尋";
"The Windows key opens your selected search app. Pro Win+S uses the same choice. Spotlight is the default. Raycast must be installed. Existing system and Raycast shortcuts stay unchanged." = "單按 Windows 鍵開啟所選搜尋 App，Pro 的 Win+S 使用同一選擇。預設使用 Spotlight；使用 Raycast 前請先安裝。系統和 Raycast 原有快速鍵保持不變。";
"Raycast could not open" = "無法開啟 Raycast";
"Raycast is not installed or its app identity could not be verified. Install Raycast from raycast.com, or choose Spotlight in Windsify settings, then try again." = "未安裝 Raycast，或無法確認 App 身份。請從 raycast.com 安裝 Raycast，或在 Windsify 設定中選擇 Spotlight，然後重試。";
"Raycast could not be activated. Open Raycast from Applications and try again, or choose Spotlight in Windsify settings." = "無法啟用 Raycast。請從“應用程式”開啟 Raycast 後重試，或在 Windsify 設定中選擇 Spotlight。";

"Continue / 继续 / 繼續" = "Continue / 继续 / 繼續";
